{# About #}
<section class="block container" id="about" data-aos="zoom-in">
    <header class="block__header">
        <h2>The Person Behind the Code</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid--1x2 about">
        <div class="about__image">
            <img src="/assets/images/about.png" alt="Héber Sandoval, Founder & Developer" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="about__content">
            <p>
                With 8 years of development experience — from small codebases to complex, collaborative projects across retail, logistics, energy, and healthcare — I've learned that good software isn't just about clean code. It's about understanding the people who'll actually use it. Before development, I worked directly with patients and providers in healthcare, which shapes how I approach every project today: listen first, build what actually solves the problem.
            </p>

            <div class="about__tagline">
                <span class="icon-container icon-container--accent">
                    <svg class="icon icon--white icon--small">
                        <use xlink:href="/assets/images/icons/sprite.svg#quotes"></use>
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <blockquote class="quote">
                    <p class="quote__text">Happiness is not a destination — it's a journey.</p>
                </blockquote>
            </div>

            <p class="about__attribution">— Héber Sandoval, Founder & Developer</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>